{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-08_beg","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-08","title":"人心，向背無常","storyCode":"R8-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"92f0823439c5362c28af764447835bf3955441c3ff35bacefc858b99b395ed4b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"塔露拉容許隊伍中一部分感染者離開，並為此與愛國者展開爭論。而那些離開的感染者卻出賣塔露拉隊伍，希望他們引走烏薩斯的軍隊。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"暉潔：\n我們一路向南。\n遊擊隊希望趕在各礦場的感染者滅絕計畫之前盡可能多地救下感染者。\n駐軍一路後退，我們一路前進。\n看起來可能就像我們在追擊烏薩斯的部隊一樣，但這肯定不可能。\n我們是一邊躲避著烏薩斯的常規軍，一邊在他們的眼皮底下救下感染者。\n這麼做的理由，我想只能說是“我們應該這麼做”。\n但我想，透過吸納更多感染者，為其他部隊爭取空間，同樣也在愛國者先生的戰略規劃之內。\n愛國者可能劃下了一條線，一條我們不會跨過的線。\n跨過那條線意味著我們要嘛和烏薩斯駐軍正面開戰——這是絕對不可能的事——要嘛，我們就必須潛伏起來。\n也就是說，離開雪原可能意味著，我們要隱秘地邁入烏薩斯真正的疆域，被嚴苛法度管轄著的移動領土。\n在那時，遊擊隊將收起他們的武器，直到我們重新找到爆發的機會。\n荒野裡活躍著烏薩斯的軍艦，城鎮對感染者只會更加殘忍。那一定會是一段艱難的日子。\n想要邁出這一步，的確太難了。\n但在西北凍原......只有雪。\n只有雪的土地是養活不了大家的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ruins_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"11月3日\n第X年"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟姐妹們，沒事吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是場惡戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你們，雪怪。有你們和我一起做先鋒，感覺很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"有塔露拉你在身邊，我們的感覺也是一樣的。你和我們配合得很好，難怪大姊肯放心讓你帶我們作戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，你的法術越來越高明了。讓火從寒氣中間穿過去來引爆，我怎麼可能想得到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我那......並不是火。說起來也挺複雜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊一定也會開心的。我們現在也不用那麼依賴她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還會在這裡遇到更多烏薩斯軍嗎，塔露拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"這座城市本來就是烏薩斯三年前拆遷計畫中的一環。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"又是因為一次貪污，或者一場不合規的行動，這支部隊佔據了這座城市......奴役，或者，驅逐了本地的居民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"至少我們面前的他們已經不堪一擊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"他們可沒你說的那麼脆弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我說的是，相對烏薩斯正規的部隊來說。愛國者也沒有讓你們參加更加艱難的戰鬥吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。大爹確實覺得我們還不夠格。現在的話准沒問題，我們和大姊已經輕車熟路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"但真正的烏薩斯軍，比這支沒有紀律、缺乏訓練......甚至可能已經不在編制之中的支隊，強上太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是不堪一擊的烏薩斯軍，我們也只能靠戰術略略勝過他們一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......那我們是不是沒什麼可高興的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"也不。我們取得了我們賴以生存的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不獲得這批資源，我們沒法度過這個冬天。這是我們一定要爭取到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，就算這座移動城市又舊又破又小......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"對我們來說已經很大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可是一次都沒住上過移動城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得......我記得你是蜷耳村的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可也是個大隊！和你們遊擊隊沒什麼兩樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"有些遺憾，因為我不是遊擊隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們這回出的人比你們多得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你叫我有什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我們就在這裡分道揚鑣吧，塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你是認真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也和你們一起打了很多場仗了！我們也為你們做了很多事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"這座城裡的資源我們可以五五分成。給你們多一些也沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"但是這座城市就留給我們吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"有了這座城......我們能去很多地方。我們可以在冰原上四處行駛，糾察隊和烏薩斯軍找不到我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不願意再繼續戰鬥了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"會死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......我們有點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"那些敵人......越來越強了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人甚至比不過愛國者的遊擊隊曾經面對過的任何一支勁旅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，你不會不同意的，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你這都是在說些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"雪怪......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們這些沒有體溫的傢伙當然不怕死了，我們可......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"（揮手示意佩特洛娃停下）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們會立刻取走資源，這座城市就留給你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"那太好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，不准侮辱任何一個戰士。向雪怪道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣行了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特洛娃，召集戰士。我們去清點資源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"（還有，把我們收繳的那台烏薩斯通信終端打開。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"（你是說......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"（他們知道愛國者的遊擊隊不在。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你往哪去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"愛國者先生？我正準備與您會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把城市，拱手讓人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"看來您已經收到了我的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——他們的行為可以稱作是背叛。你的准許令他們得到正當理由。你毀壞了紀律的執行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"從他們要求要走的那一刻開始，我們就留不住他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有信念之人，無毅力之人，從頭至尾，不應戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"按照這個標準，沒有人在最初就有參加戰鬥的資格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紀律勝過鐵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殺死他們，奪回城市。這是你應為你的隊伍和你的同胞做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"讓他們知道感染者為了一座破敗的城市，可以殺掉一群走投無路的人，可以用同胞的血去潤滑它的齒輪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們違反紀律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"他們從頭至尾就不是為了紀律在戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"距我第一次見你，已經過去四年。我從未正式命令過你，只是任你參加，或者拒絕合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我不知道你比起以前是更加成熟，還是變得軟弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"是因為我反對你的觀點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在只要號召其他的感染者，只要宣佈他們背叛了感染者的事業，他們就會立刻被處死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當把他們的行徑公之於眾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你猶豫了。因為他們是感染者，你猶豫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得這不榮譽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不熱愛謀殺，也不執著權力，這當然好。那你也許需要有人去做這事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，我並非不敢這麼去做，也不自封比他人更道德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼我與遊擊隊去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你不願與他們交惡，那遊擊隊去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼？你那是什麼表情？真認為我像他們所說的那樣......是一個所謂純粹而崇高的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種人在這場戰爭開始前就死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了戰爭的勝利與對勝利果實的維護，又有什麼是榮譽的？戰勝可憎的敵人天生就是榮譽，我卻不為更多犧牲而感到驕傲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有一件事能夠令我們取得勝利，能讓我們少死一兩個同胞，這件事就是正確的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"這座缺乏維護的城市不出幾年就會損壞。它服務人類的時間已經遠長於它被設計應有的壽命了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你我都知道，他們的最終命運依然是在冰原上停步，他們依然要自己找到出路。即使只有這三年時間，他們依然為自己點燃了一個希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會掐滅這個希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你任由他人分化我們的隊伍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不對。我已經說了......他們從最開始就不屬於我們的隊伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會像您那樣說“一個人因為軟弱就不能奮起戰鬥”，我只會說“有的人尚不能理解我們所想”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我們將有許多同行人。但不是他們中的每一個都服務於我們的目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我們借用他們的力量，而不是徵用。徵用只會讓他們與自己原本的目標相悖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"猜忌和離心將更加不可避免。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊伍的純潔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您願意用這個詞的話。顯然我不喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的確是算得上一個正直的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"附近駐紮著一支更加訓練有素的商道守軍。不幸必然會發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我不願承認，但是沒錯，他們有可能會這麼做，所以我們應當做好準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"雪怪已經......收到了發報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，從移動城市裡發出了訊息，投給了這個區域裡的烏薩斯駐軍，把我們的位置暴露給了他們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們在利用我們去引開烏薩斯軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來的這場戰鬥，誰也不想它發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的愚昧會讓他們一步步滑向毀滅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
